    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Choose what this computer does</h4>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">After installation: create on the storage host, then connect the other computers. These commands are interactive and may request administrator approval.</p>
