        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">On the storage host, choose an existing or new source folder and trusted computers or private subnet. Existing files stay in place; review administrator changes before approving.</p><pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-700"><code>~/.local/bin/autobyteus-nfs create</code></pre>
