        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">Print the installed version without configuring storage.</p><pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-700"><code>~/.local/bin/autobyteus-nfs version</code></pre>
